ec: Update signing key to redhatsecureboot802\n- Resolves: #RHEL-116730</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Leo Sandoval &lt;lsandova@redhat.com&gt; 2.12-32" date="1761652800">- Disable annobin stack protection check\n- Resolves: #RHEL-89464</changelog>\n</package>\n')
